+# QNX 6.5: libgcc.a must contain the ARM EABI helpers (__aeabi_uidiv,
+# __aeabi_idiv, __aeabi_uldivmod and more), as the SDP GCC 4.4.2 libgcc.a
+# does. libc.so.3 exports them. libc.a only calls them, thus a -static
+# link has no other definition. lib1funcs.S has no L_dvmd_nto section.
